# Representative legacy FVWM syntax, including continuation and theme reload.
Echo compat-read-begin
Colorset 7 fg white, bg #203040
Colorset 8 fg black, bg #c0d0e0
DestroyDecor recreate CompatDecor
AddToDecor CompatDecor
+ TitleStyle Centered Height 24 -- Flat
+ ButtonStyle All ActiveUp Vector 5 15x15@4 15x85@3 85x85@3 \
    85x15@3 15x15@4
+ BorderStyle Colorset 7 -- NoInset
Style * UseDecor CompatDecor, BorderWidth 3, HandleWidth 3, \
    Font fixed, IconFont fixed, Colorset 7, HilightColorset 8, \
    TileCascadePlacement
DestroyMenu CompatMenu
AddToMenu CompatMenu "Compatibility" Title
+ "Resize" CompatResize
+ "Close" Close
MenuStyle CompatMenu Font fixed, MenuColorset 7, ActiveColorset 8
DestroyFunc CompatResize
AddToFunc CompatResize I Echo compat-function-begin
+ I Resize 280p 160p
+ I Move 120p 90p
+ I Echo compat-function-end
DestroyFunc CompatBinding
AddToFunc CompatBinding I Echo compat-binding
Key F8 A N CompatBinding
Mouse 1 R N CompatBinding
Read "$[FVWM_COMPAT_ROOT]/nested config.fvwm"
PipeRead "cat '$[FVWM_COMPAT_ROOT]/pipe config.fvwm'"
Echo compat-read-end
